---
# The single formatting configuration of this repository. Both
# `tools/format.py --write` and `tools/format.py --check` (CMake targets
# `format` and `format-check`) use exactly this file, through the pinned
# clang-format 18.1.8 of tools/requirements-format.txt. It is based on the
# Google style with its default two-space indentation and inherits from no
# other project style.
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
Standard: c++17
IndentWidth: 2
ColumnLimit: 80
...
